    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Sana Javadi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100378472001252893379/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKo0_CNCWZYJRrtEvWPQgtWmrv0O1ydzvO-hKQ_z015WA30WMg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I used so many different products for myself and recommended to so many friends. Everyone is happy with the quality and results. The products are very effective and you feel the result in couple of days.",
        "time": 1762266879,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lindsay Fletcher",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100195710727735747858/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXCIlSqHruIuw0Vpj8A_y75JC--uzEUzfaBXPYNVQGMZ337mwzd=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Overall I love the quality of these supplements and the price is good too in comparison to other brands with similar quality ingredients. For example, I have used your prenatals, when compared to others they are really good. Your Silica tastes great. The wild oregano is one of the best in the market. I worked at a health food store and have learned about many products and I have to say New Roots is one of my favorites overall. And I love that you're Canadian! And apparently a lot closer to Ottawa then I knew, very cool!",
        "time": 1741839315,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lili Crawford",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113528204572534018680/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQaJs8eS6fEJ56756hqT6Q0PMAXUT7efmVQ4urLtGt-vs9-vg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Purchased a $20 bottle of K2+D3 from Whole Foods. There was no clear way to dispense drops. Ended up having to use an oversized dropper from another product. Which has proved to be a messy annoyance. I emailed the company a week ago and was assured I'd hear back from someone. No such luck. I'll be returning the bottle to today.\n\nUpdate: Their response went into my junk mail. Basically, I am told the high viscosity of the MCT oil makes it come out of the top VERY slowly. Can't test this as I returned the bottle this morning. But having to wait upwards of 4-5 seconds for that first drop is a bit frustrating. I think some improvement in the delivery system is in order.",
        "time": 1641926154,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jordin Lantos",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109827018141102654686/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLmNTVi26vWwPRc-h6CYuKjB86q5BMFTxFb1W07zSZ-mGYXYFo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Fantastic company. Best of the best.\n\nLeading formula's, laboratory tested and much cheaper than other top companies like AOR. One of the great things about New Roots is they are constantly well ahead of many other top companies in terms of leading research and formulations.\n\nGreat quality. No fillers. And most importantly, only the highest quality ingredients.",
        "time": 1640988735,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "White Prisms",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110815365507358853180/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwUMU1XMN87VGHvRkgwmHKG6thzecQrZs9uqH43A92wsmYFtkB=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
